{"unit_id":"fotor-ai__dsh-fotor-plugin#feature-image","repo":"fotor-ai/dsh-fotor-plugin","commit":"2ccdd39f063203b4727a53e5e244d3f6fceafef8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Fotor 的图像处理功能：通过 MCP 工具生成或编辑图片，也可单独放大图片或移除背景。生成和编辑使用所选模型及其支持参数；放大和去背景接收图片 URL 并返回任务结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/fotor-image/SKILL.md:1-22"]}
{"unit_id":"fotor-ai__dsh-fotor-plugin#feature-video","repo":"fotor-ai/dsh-fotor-plugin","commit":"2ccdd39f063203b4727a53e5e244d3f6fceafef8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Fotor 的视频生成功能：根据文字、首帧、首尾帧或多模态参考素材提交视频任务。用户选择视频模式和模型，提供提示词及可访问的素材 URL，获得生成任务结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/fotor-video/SKILL.md:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"fotor-ai__dsh-fotor-plugin#feature-audio","repo":"fotor-ai/dsh-fotor-plugin","commit":"2ccdd39f063203b4727a53e5e244d3f6fceafef8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Fotor 的音频功能：可创作配乐或新曲、延长和编辑歌曲、合成语音或播客，并分离人声与伴奏。用户按操作提供音频、文字或参考素材，服务返回音频文件或任务结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/fotor-audio/SKILL.md:1-25"]}
{"unit_id":"fotor-ai__dsh-fotor-plugin#feature-upload","repo":"fotor-ai/dsh-fotor-plugin","commit":"2ccdd39f063203b4727a53e5e244d3f6fceafef8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Fotor 的素材上传功能：将本地图片、视频或音频上传到 Fotor，返回可供后续媒体任务使用的文件 URL；也可单独上传并查看每个文件的上传结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/fotor-upload/SKILL.md:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"fotor-ai__dsh-fotor-plugin#caveat-auth","repo":"fotor-ai/dsh-fotor-plugin","commit":"2ccdd39f063203b4727a53e5e244d3f6fceafef8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Fotor MCP 连接使用 https://mcp.fotor.com/mcp；首次或授权失效时可能需要在浏览器完成服务授权，用户需有可用的 Fotor 账户。","source":"generated","evidence":["runtime/config.mjs:11","runtime/mcp.mjs:15-20"]}
{"unit_id":"fotor-ai__dsh-fotor-plugin#caveat-node","repo":"fotor-ai/dsh-fotor-plugin","commit":"2ccdd39f063203b4727a53e5e244d3f6fceafef8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"插件连接依赖本机支持的 Node.js（24.2+ 的 24.x 或 26.x），并默认使用本机 3335 端口进行授权回调。","source":"generated","evidence":["runtime/config.mjs:15-18","runtime/config.mjs:69-72"]}
